stoms</a></nav><div class="k_45aaab5_tools"><div class="k_e0485b1_control"><audio loop="" preload="none"></audio><button type="button" class="k_e0485b1_toggle " aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Music is not connected yet. View track information"><svg class="k_e0485b1_wave" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="17" height="17" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8v4M7 4v12M11 6v8M15 3v14M19 8v4"></path></svg><span>SOUND OFF</span></button><button type="button" class="k_e0485b1_settings" aria-label="Music volume and track information" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_7a_-panel"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="15" height="15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3v14M15 3v14M2 7h6M12 13h6"></path></svg></button></div><select class="k_554b53f_select" aria-label="Site language"><option value="zh" lang="zh-CN">中文</option><option value="en" lang="en" selected="">EN</option><option value="ja" lang="ja">日本語</option></select><button type="button" class="k_45aaab5_menuToggle " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="site-navigation-menu" aria-label="Open navigation menu"><span>Menu</span><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 6h16M2 13h16"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main class="kagura-collection-page"><div class="k_72a5680_root" lang="en"><section class="k_72a5680_intro" aria-labelledby="brand-title"><div class="k_72a5680_introTop"><span>ART. ORIGINAL WORLDS. COLLECTIBLE OBJECTS.</span><span>KIKORA / A WORLD IN THE MAKING</span></div><div class="k_72a5680_heroGrid"><div class="k_72a5680_heroCopy"><p class="k_72a5680_eyebrow">For collectors of anime, gaming and street culture</p><h1 id="brand-title" lang="en">COLLECT<br/>YOUR<br/><span>WORLD.</span></h1><h2>An artist’s world.<br/>A place in your collection.</h2><p class="k_72a5680_heroDescription">Original characters and ideas, imagined as limited-edition objects.<br/>We’re shaping a KIKORA built around artists, players and the worlds they love.</p><div class="k_72a5680_heroActions"><a href="#manifesto">Step into our world<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a><a href="#creators">Artist collaborations<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div><div class="k_72a5680_heroCollage" aria-label="KIKORA artwork and collectible design studies"><div class="k_72a5680_collageGrid" aria-hidden="true"></div><span class="k_72a5680_collageCoordinates">ARTWORK → OBJECT → COLLECTION</span><figure class="k_72a5680_heroWraith"><div><img alt="Wraith visual study with an icy blue palette and architectural setting" sizes="(max-width:760px) 57vw, 32vw" src="{{ 'kikora-images-album-concept-wraith.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;inset:0;color:transparent" loading="eager" decoding="async" fetchPriority="high"/></div><figcaption><span>01 / VISUAL STUDY</span><span>VOID FM.</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="k_72a5680_heroReyna"><div><img alt="Reyna album-cover portrait study in red and violet-blue" sizes="(max-width:760px) 50vw, 27vw" src="{{ 'kikora-images-album-concept-reyna.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;inset:0;color:transparent" loading="eager" decoding="async" fetchPriority="high"/></div><figcaption><span>02 / COVER STUDY</span><span>STARPLAYER.</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="k_72a5680_heroKeys"><div><img alt="Reyna keycap concept with artwork spanning the full keyboard" sizes="(max-width:760px) 52vw, 25vw" src="{{ 'kikora-images-kagura-keycaps-cover.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;inset:0;color:transparent" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>ART, IN ANOTHER FORM.<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></figcaption></figure><div class="k_72a5680_collageSeal" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="" viewBox="8 4 112 112" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18 52 64 22 108 39 89 52 66 43 38 61 38 90 18 82Z"></path><path d="M66 76 90 60 110 68 66 97Z" opacity=".55"></path><path d="M48 69v21l18 7v-21Z" opacity=".83"></path></svg><small lang="en">IMAGINE.<br/>CREATE.<br/>COLLECT.</small></div></div></div><div class="k_72a5680_introBottom"><a href="#manifesto">THE STORY BEGINS HERE<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><p>Images show visual and product studies, not released artist collaborations.</p><span>INDEPENDENT WORLDS / SHARED PASSION</span></div></section><section id="manifesto" class="k_72a5680_manifesto" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title"><div class="k_72a5680_manifestoSide"><span class="k_72a5680_eyebrow">WHY KIKORA EXISTS</span><span class="k_72a5680_sectionIndex">[ 01 — 03 ]</span></div><div><h2 id="manifesto-title">Some worlds deserve<br/>a place <span>beyond the screen.</span></h2><div class="k_72a5680_manifestoCopy"><p>Sometimes a character feels familiar before we know why. Sometimes a piece of art says exactly what we can’t. We collect to keep that connection close. That’s where KIKORA begins.</p><p>We hope to collaborate with independent artists and original IP creators across China, exploring limited-edition art through glass mousepads, keycaps and custom metal objects. New forms for an artist’s vision. New ways to make a collection your own.</p></div></div></section><section id="our-story" class="k_72a5680_story" aria-label="Three chapters from artistic vision to personal collection"><div class="k_72a5680_pinned"><div class="k_72a5680_storyTop"><span>FROM AN ARTIST’S WORLD TO YOURS.</span><div class="k_72a5680_chapterNav" aria-label="Story chapters"><button type="button" aria-label="Go to chapter 1" aria-current="step">01<i></i></button><button type="button" aria-label="Go to chapter 2">02<i></i></button><button type="button" aria-label="Go to chapter 3">03<i></i></button></div></div><div class="k_72a5680_chapters"><article id="story-chapter-0" class="k_72a5680_chapter" data-active="true"><div class="k_72a5680_chapterCopy"><p class="k_72a5680_eyebrow">01<!-- --> / <!-- -->ONE ARTIST. ONE WORLD.</p><h2>A signature style.<br/>A world of its own.</h2><p class="k_72a5680_description">Distinctive characters. A visual language you recognise. Stories with somewhere to go. We hope to work with independent artists to give their original worlds a new life as collectibles.</p><span class="k_72a5680_chapterNote">A PERSONAL VISION / CREATOR FIRST</span></div><div class="k_72a5680_chapterVisual undefined" aria-hidden="true"><div class="k_72a5680_artistFrame"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width:760px) 60vw, 35vw" src="{{ 'kikora-images-album-concept-reyna.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;inset:0;color:transparent" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="k_72a5680_artistSlip"><span>THE CREATIVE<br/>UNIVERSE</span><p>CHARACTER<br/>STYLE<br/>STORY</p><i>It starts with a voice of its own.</i></div><span class="k_72a5680_visualCaption">VISUAL STUDY / PERSONAL EXPRESSION</span></div></article><article id="story-chapter-1" class="k_72a5680_chapter" data-active="false"><div class="k_72a5680_chapterCopy"><p class="k_72a5680_eyebrow">02<!-- --> / <!-- -->ART TAKES FORM.</p><h2>From an idea<br/>to an object to keep.</h2><p class="k_72a5680_description">An image unfolds across glass. Colour finds a rhythm in keycaps. A silhouette gains weight in metal. Each material offers a new way to bring an artist’s vision into the world.</p><span class="k_72a5680_chapterNote">FROM IMAGE TO OBJECT / ART INTO OBJECTS</span></div><div class="k_72a5680_chapterVisual undefined" aria-hidden="true"><div class="k_72a5680_materialPhoto"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width:760px) 85vw, 48vw" src="{{ 'kikora-images-kagura-keycaps-cover.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;inset:0;color:transparent" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="k_72a5680_materialSwatches"><span>GLASS<i></i></span><span>KEYCAPS<i></i></span><span>METAL<i></i></span></div><span class="k_72a5680_visualCaption">ONE CREATIVE WORLD. MULTIPLE FORMS.</span></div></article><article id="story-chapter-2" class="k_72a5680_chapter" data-active="false"><div class="k_72a5680_chapterCopy"><p class="k_72a5680_eyebrow">03<!-- --> / <!-- -->LIVE WITH YOUR COLLECTION.</p><h2>Keep it close.<br/>Make it part of your day.</h2><p class="k_72a5680_description">Collect for the character, the style, the feeling that stays with you. Give those worlds a place on your desk, alongside the games you play and the things you make.</p><span class="k_72a5680_chapterNote">COLLECT WHAT CONNECTS / MADE PERSONAL</span></div><div class="k_72a5680_chapterVisual undefined" aria-hidden="true"><div class="k_72a5680_collectorArt"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width:760px) 64vw, 35vw" src="{{ 'kikora-images-album-concept-wraith.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;inset:0;color:transparent" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="k_72a5680_collectorLabel"><span>KIKORA / COLLECTION NOTES</span><strong>FOR THE<br/>WORLDS<br/>YOU LOVE.</strong><p>Room for what you love.<br/>Room for the next story.</p><div>ART × PLAY × EVERYDAY</div></div><span class="k_72a5680_visualCaption">YOUR COLLECTION. YOUR POINT OF VIEW.</span></div></article></div><div class="k_72a5680_storyBottom"><span>IMAGINE. CREATE. COLLECT.</span><div class="k_72a5680_progress" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div><a href="#creators">THE NEXT CHAPTER<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a></div></div></section><section id="creators" class="k_72a5680_creators" aria-labelledby="creators-title"><div class="k_72a5680_creatorsHeading"><div><p class="k_72a5680_eyebrow">KIKORA ARTIST COLLABORATIONS</p><h2 id="creators-title">Your world could inspire<br/>our next <span>collectible.</span></h2></div><span class="k_72a5680_planStatus"><i></i>First artist collaboration programme · In development</span></div><div class="k_72a5680_creatorGrid"><div class="k_72a5680_creatorPoster"><span>AN INVITATION TO<br/>INDEPENDENT CREATORS</span><strong lang="en">YOUR IP.<br/>OUR NEXT<br/><em>CHAPTER.</em></strong><p>Independent artists / Original characters / Creator-owned IP<br/>Wherever you create, bring a world that is yours.</p><div class="k_72a5680_posterArt" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class="k_72a5680_posterFoot">THE COLLABORATION STARTS WITH YOU.</span></div><div class="k_72a5680_principles"><article><span>01</span><div><p>CREATOR FIRST</p><h3>Keep the artist in the picture.</h3><p>Our aim is to clearly credit every collaborating artist and share the ideas and stories behind their original work.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><p>CREATED TOGETHER</p><h3>Build a collection together.</h3><p>Theme, composition, material and finish: we want to shape the full expression of a collection with its creator, from artwork to physical object.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><p>LIMITED, WITH CLARITY</p><h3>Make the edition clear.</h3><p>We plan to publish edition sizes and reissue policies before each limited release. Current images are design studies; no editions are on sale yet.</p></div></article><a class="k_72a5680_creatorCta" href="mailto:support@kikoragear.com?subject=KIKORA+artist+collaboration+enquiry&amp;body=Hello+KIKORA%2C%0A%0AMy+name%3A%0APortfolio+or+original+IP+link%3A%0AWhat+I%E2%80%99d+like+to+create+together%3A%0AContact+details%3A%0A"><span>Tell us about your work<!-- --> <small>START A CONVERSATION</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div><p class="k_72a5680_creatorDisclaimer">Collaboration terms, licensing and release plans will be agreed with each creator. The concepts shown illustrate our design direction; collaborating artists have not yet been announced.</p></section><section id="discover" class="k_72a5680_discover" aria-labelledby="discover-title"><div class="k_72a5680_discoverHeading"><div><p class="k_72a5680_eyebrow">EXPLORE THE OBJECTS</p><h2 id="discover-title" lang="en">A WORLD.<br/><span>MANY FORMS.</span></h2></div><p>One connection. More than one way to collect it.<br/>Step into a category and explore the ideas taking shape.</p></div><div class="k_72a5680_categories"><article class="k_72a5680_category"><a class="k_72a5680_categoryVisual" aria-label="Explore glass mousepads" href="/pages/glass"><div class="k_72a5680_glassStudy"><img alt="Wraith glass mousepad design study" sizes="(max-width:760px) 60vw, 26vw" src="{{ 'kikora-images-album-concept-wraith.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;inset:0;color:transparent" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span>KIKORA / GLASS</span></div><span class="k_72a5680_categoryArrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="k_72a5680_categoryHeading"><span>01 / A CANVAS FOR YOUR WORLD</span><h3><a href="/pages/glass">Glass mousepads</a></h3><p>A whole world, laid out before you.</p><div class="k_72a5680_subcategories"><a href="/pages/glass-core">Core</a><a href="/pages/glass-artist">Artist editions</a><a href="/pages/glass-covers">Cover series</a></div></div></article><article class="k_72a5680_category"><a class="k_72a5680_categoryVisual" aria-label="Explore keycaps" href="/pages/keycaps"><img alt="Keycap design concept with a continuous Reyna illustration across individual keys" sizes="(max-width:760px) 90vw, 32vw" class="k_72a5680_keycapsImage" src="{{ 'kikora-images-kagura-keycaps-cover.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;inset:0;color:transparent" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="k_72a5680_categoryArrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="k_72a5680_categoryHeading"><span>02 / ART AT YOUR FINGERTIPS</span><h3><a href="/pages/keycaps">Keycaps</a></h3><p>A little art in every keystroke.</p><span class="k_72a5680_development">DESIGN STUDY</span></div></article><article class="k_72a5680_category"><a class="k_72a5680_categoryVisual" aria-label="Explore custom metal objects" href="/pages/metal"><div class="k_72a5680_metalStudy" aria-hidden="true"><i>↗</i></div><span class="k_72a5680_categoryArrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="k_72a5680_categoryHeading"><span>03 / A DIFFERENT KIND OF PRESENCE</span><h3><a href="/pages/metal">Metal customs</a></h3><p>Give an idea shape, texture and weight.</p><span class="k_72a5680_development">FUTURE OBJECTS</span></div></article></div></section><section class="k_72a5680_closing"><span>THIS WORLD IS ONLY JUST BEGINNING.</span><h2>What you love<br/>belongs here, too.</h2><a href="/pages/about">Meet KIKORA<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section></div><section id="newsletter" class="kagura-newsletter" aria-labelledby="newsletter-title"><div><p class="kagura-label">GOOD THINGS. NEXT IN LINE.</p><h2 id="newsletter-title">THE NEXT CHAPTER.</h2><p>New artwork, studio updates and the first word on future releases.</p></div><form noValidate="" class="k_df720f5_newsletter" data-light="true" aria-busy="false"><div class="k_df720f5_trap" aria-hidden="true"><label for="_R_2j_-company">Company</label><input id="_R_2j_-company" tabindex="-1" autoComplete="off" name="company"/></div><div class="k_df720f5_newsletterRow"><label class="sr-only" for="_R_2j_-email">Email address</label><input id="_R_2j_-email" type="email" autoComplete="email" required="" maxLength="120" placeholder="you@example.com" class="k_df720f5_newsletterInput" aria-describedby="_R_2j_-notice" name="email"/><button type="submit" class="k_df720f5_newsletterButton">Keep me posted</button></div><label class="k_df720f5_newsletterConsent"><input type="checkbox" required="" aria-describedby="_R_2j_-notice" name="consent"/><span>I’d like KIKORA collection news and release emails. I can unsubscribe by replying with UNSUBSCRIBE.</span></label><div id="_R_2j_-notice" class="k_df720f5_newsletterNotice" data-status="idle" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div></form></section></main><footer class="k_45aaab5_footer"><div class="k_45aaab5_footerGrid"><div class="k_45aaab5_footerBrand"><a aria-label="KIKORA home" href="/"><span cl